	name = "\improper SAW-80 'BLOODY DEVOTION'";
	desc = "Scarborough Arms' premier modular assault rifle platform. This example is configured as a support weapon, with heavier components for sustained firing and a large muzzle brake. Chambered in 5.56mm CLIP. Jesus fucking christ, how did she get her hands on this?"
